The DWS312 Door/Window Sensor detects door and window openings and closings, with easy installation and tamper protection.

## Key Features

- ZigBee HA1.2 compliant, compatible with other ZigBee products
- Easy installation
- Tamper protection protects the enclosure from being opened
- Low battery detection
- Low power consumption
- 1-year battery life with CR2450 3V lithium battery
